#. Status: mt
#. Phase: 1
#: templates/mail-guide.html:41
msgid ""
"As an alternative to IMAP you can also use the POP protocol: choose POP "
"as the protocol, port 995, and SSL or TLS security in your mail client. "
"The SMTP settings and usernames and passwords remain the same. However, "
"we recommend you use IMAP instead."
msgstr ""
